      "sourceTextSha256": "bc586ae992505a71aae3fc23214965791780e30e13982979fdd8cdba0d4e4d6e",
      "text": "Breakfast. Full-day “7 Lakes” tour with an English-speaking guide and private transport. Follow the Limay River valley to the Amphitheatre viewpoint, 35 km from the hotel, overlooking rivers and peninsulas, and continue among rock formations towards Cuyín Manzano. Drive along Lake Traful to the Traful viewpoint and the village of Villa Traful, ideal for lunch, tea, local chocolate and homemade sweets, stop at a sandy beach on the lake, then continue to Villa La Angostura, on Lake Correntoso, before returning to Bariloche.",
